{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "1544852c3a627c78ba7fddd5076db915d26925e4962a5dcc00edc94d40ae8ddb", "ja": "夢", "zh": "梦想", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7d57c1f4dac12c2e5542dc51ccfd5190b64bce2865f0fa41e90b38e2e71ef22c", "ja": "これまでを振り返っているアイドル達。\n志保はなかなかうまくいかないユニット活動\nや、家族との気持ちのすれ違いに絶望し失踪\nしてしまう。可奈、海美、星梨花は志保を探\nし出し、一緒にいると手を伸ばすのだった。", "zh": "回顾至今经历的偶像们。  \n志保因组合活动迟迟不顺利，  \n又因与家人心意不合而陷入绝望，最终离家出走。可奈、海美和星梨花找到了志保，  \n向她伸出手，告诉她会陪在她身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1048_033sih", "source_sha256": "0912e9fd4b3924d0c8f08cc9455cd2a5eda6b0186a335987268e2eec17fec545", "ja": "時々私は夢を見た", "zh": "有时我会做梦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "d2f7961ab0ae0d1bafb138938ddc1d0e1b8898a61c7c45c34776ce6d29b9a190", "ja": "年に一度　一泊でもいい\n家族みんなで旅行に行けたら", "zh": "一年一次也好，住上一晚也行\n要是能全家人一起去旅行就好了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1050_033sih", "source_sha256": "c8b38732e153468c3731b05b4ed43dc3dbaafb4a7279057a6835ac5772cc2d63", "ja": "外食で母が値段を気にせず\n好きなものを食べてくれたら", "zh": "在外面吃饭时，要是妈妈不用在意价钱，\n能点自己喜欢吃的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1051_033sih", "source_sha256": "ae197a996871fe62f03bcdeea5620872f7ffedce47893639b581946eea002900", "ja": "弟にプレゼントを買うことができたら……", "zh": "如果能给弟弟买礼物的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1052_033sih", "source_sha256": "2e0b5d625710bb63f7b7d93fbe86c969168ff18e780aca71aa92b9f5451d27cd", "ja": "私の夢は、一人前のアイドルになって\n家族を幸せに……笑顔にすること", "zh": "我的梦想是成为独当一面的偶像，让家人幸福……让他们露出笑容", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "026be95238c22cb9090074e61c95f3f845057b0ff532fc4e2f42536452e50e24", "ja": "私の夢は……", "zh": "我的梦想是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1054_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "57e50f348d04cc34a54f25acc1437aa7717700d5e53a9c2c8100b7d780e48b36", "ja": "志保。陸がまだ熱下がってないのに\n保育園行くって聞かなくて。", "zh": "志保。陆明明还没退烧，\n却硬闹着要去托儿所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1055_riku", "source_sha256": "7e0fce61e1891a69868e48421d37719f5be37ffde5df5ad868423019952ebeb4", "ja": "おねえちゃんに迷惑かけたくないから……", "zh": "因为不想给姐姐添麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1056_033sih", "source_sha256": "a5927cd7bcc981d9776299361603c4cce7a3ec889dd4348760c7faa87d40cb35", "ja": "りっくん、お姉ちゃんなら全然平気だよ。", "zh": "小陆，姐姐真的完全没事哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1057_riku", "source_sha256": "6fbdd0da7011d504050da7da72c48dd3d32a53a1ce26a38ad04e5b2710e135a4", "ja": "でもおねえちゃんは家を出ていきたいんでしょ。", "zh": "不过，姐姐还是想离开家，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1059_riku", "source_sha256": "eaf5558ddccd615f98730b4188035c8416e657fc7232bb567334da92e67b6706", "ja": "おねえちゃんが……アイドルが大好きなのもわかるけど\nぼくはおねえちゃんと一緒に……いたいから。", "zh": "我知道姐姐……非常喜欢偶像，\n但我想和姐姐一起……待在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1060_033sih", "source_sha256": "8bfa7fd295a689e65f5a9905682f6cce0b366802e5230881de5a020a79f59460", "ja": "（りっくん……）", "zh": "（小律……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1061_riku", "source_sha256": "9393041de00a4eb928871690a6c4a3642d2385f123833991422b98c1a0b75300", "ja": "ぼくが……しっかりしないと……。", "zh": "我……得振作起来才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1062_033sih", "source_sha256": "6dc17b3cb7b6945bdafc76e75ea120b1d19eeebe4ecad262e20d63b4ca600893", "ja": "（なんで……、なんでわかってくれないの！！）", "zh": "（为什么……为什么你就是不明白啊！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1063_033sih", "source_sha256": "d4b37ec10209d919f378a534a1f797f7e1a71d2960d392388ae4240090fbdddf", "ja": "りっくん！！！！", "zh": "小陆！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1065_riku", "source_sha256": "2dfe3b20e97ee465a22c0235adb408361d425faa66ace1d933088171127bfebd", "ja": "ふっ。ぐ……。\nふぐっ……、う……、うっ……。", "zh": "呜。咕……。\n呜……、呜……、呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1066_033sih", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1067_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "71938eea0d92d55ef28eb4bc45831805ea3b60aa4915d4340b5609f7569be502", "ja": "志保ちゃんが姿を消した！？", "zh": "志保失踪了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1001_405bcp", "source_sha256": "b8ed7d9cdc14af1f0493567cb7d120ccf2b1e3da68d8a0b48845c7fe650efa98", "ja": "……今、志保の母親から連絡があってな。\n今朝家を出てから学校にいっていないらしい。", "zh": "……刚才志保的母亲联系我了。\n据说她今天早上离开家后，就没去学校。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1002_405bcp", "source_sha256": "93dcf5de197441e215436b67941e69be96082df5dc5ef780bfe084ebcabdfa8d", "ja": "携帯も家に置いたままだから、\n志保がどこにいるか分からないみたいなんだ。", "zh": "她连手机也留在家里了，所以好像没人知道志保现在在哪里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1003_405bcp", "source_sha256": "42c06fa9fff7115846f77820efe1c05971999aff378619c09b89f92fe7295e25", "ja": "みんな、志保の行きそうなところ\n心当たりあるか？", "zh": "大家知道志保可能会去哪里吗？\n有头绪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "3ea45588e98c85abd64d6e0776ccbdfd635b5f1b7c37d5e4fa9493ce450a9968", "ja": "もしかして私のせい……かな。", "zh": "难道是因为我……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "ac803e46e879f30b337f23b6cc547a052d94433406d5f3c534cd6aa6b8665189", "ja": "昨日、私がしほりんの気持ちを考えないで、\nしほりんを傷つけちゃったから……。", "zh": "昨天，我没有考虑到志保的心情，\n就这样伤害了她……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1007_405bcp", "source_sha256": "fa34643b007833f9a76d3981d19a0920984b41c5dc835fc955bb058a7ce23ac7", "ja": "成果なし……か。あとはオレとスタッフにまかせて\n今日はみんな家に帰ってくれ。", "zh": "毫无成果……吗。接下来就交给我和工作人员，大家今天都回家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "45fef467b409344c15f0fc57e75934f692b09e657641fe0c1eb9dfa22edeb5c6", "ja": "プロデューサーさん！", "zh": "制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1009_405bcp", "source_sha256": "e81079be1a7f3b85e8239e76866e0fbf0069b2c01679c4df544fa5181f3b1f00", "ja": "夜の雨の中で歩いて\nみんなに何かあったらことだし。", "zh": "要是大家冒着夜雨走过去，\n万一出了什么事就糟了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1010_405bcp", "source_sha256": "abd29d48dff2350b48ba2d1a13e8bdc574f2d9118c72b7abeadbca03e297a676", "ja": "今、可奈がここにいても\nできることは何もないんだ。", "zh": "现在可奈就算在这里，也什么都做不了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "d601be6614ee30f46ce4dd8f5abe81c997393f8347dc556561053535ae5b526a", "ja": "かなりん……。", "zh": "可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1012_405bcp", "source_sha256": "3fdcbede226ebfc11b6ac2d18e9ad83b107ccaf4eb158f2a95e6338de8499f5f", "ja": "可奈！？", "zh": "可奈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1014_se", "source_sha256": "02e574dc06d7cff9e6032263ae0a43f1c5a0ed7908fbc4c1edfdd45803570793", "ja": "ぴしゃん", "zh": "啪嗒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "07b27284dde2ead44668b42daa0b3f08a053755616e667b70138280bc38d87da", "ja": "志保……ちゃん、いつもここで……\nがんばって……たから。", "zh": "志保……一直在这里……\n努力……练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "d63f64ca70711de3065dcd20f0fccb4f82307957c6d82eef2804ab665735115c", "ja": "絶対ここに……来るかなって。", "zh": "我想着你一定会……来这里的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "11c7087296422a71310ff769eb5c36f2bc85cd12f1f4ed44e4d6a660f7dc6399", "ja": "……。\n矢吹さん……。", "zh": "……。\n矢吹同学……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "532932708c999d7c05416f8a6c429e4bbba3e0b24481dbaf59c185b5359506f6", "ja": "志保ちゃん、あのね……。", "zh": "志保，那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "9698342d953725eeaa4b9eed4fa74f8e7b63616de740c9bcea83e4394c5b3031", "ja": "矢吹さん、今までごめんなさい。", "zh": "矢吹同学，之前一直对不起你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "e99d58a8c557d9309db04e51a954795a87c8d4fb4753e5a8133d820dacb1da77", "ja": "私はアイドルとしても、ユニットのリーダーとしても\n力不足で、これ以上活動を続ける自信がなくなったの。", "zh": "我不管是作为偶像，还是作为组合队长，都觉得自己能力不足，已经没有信心继续活动下去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "c6bfc9352c4e7c5cc5c773db00fee097fd1d14b1e657997676624f6334c4b017", "ja": "指導係なんて名前だけで……。\n情けない昨日の私を見て、矢吹さんも幻滅したでしょ。", "zh": "所谓指导员也只是挂个名而已……。\n看到昨天那个没用的我，矢吹同学也对我失望了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "77241fbeabfb7f3761d1041a02e35f9b1fef91c367932dd3f657a68bf8e12022", "ja": "だから……私は、アイドルを……。", "zh": "所以……我想成为偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "1779d7bd15ec7586073ab39e10302b476b44d1ab31f4dae09036201508c3008f", "ja": "矢吹可奈！！\n一曲歌わせてくださいっ！！", "zh": "矢吹可奈！！\n请让我唱一首歌吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "ff143d845a8c7fe50d1fa76b23cb144dae9581f447d650742917d80b182df348", "ja": "（志保ちゃんに聞いて欲しい歌があるんだ。\n私のはじまりの歌……）", "zh": "（我有一首歌想唱给志保听。\n那是我的起点之歌……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "f1990d37fe703484fbfe27f8cb052d809cadaee72b3d82b342563dc692575b0c", "ja": "（アイドルを夢見た、私たちのはじまりの歌を！！）", "zh": "（这首歌，是我们梦想成为偶像时的起点之歌！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "38e1cb27e8b5ebd311fa970666855cd798f38543ecb96e50bea4d7c1d06d3935", "ja": "はあ……はあ……志保ちゃん……\n私が歌が好きなのは……私が歌って楽しいから。", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……志保……\n我喜欢唱歌……是因为唱歌能让我感到快乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "6b1d7cdb5a80a7cf3578e1fa35f6858d9432a500fa3c76c9f58749da614ff651", "ja": "私の歌で誰かが笑顔になってくれるとき、\nとってもうれしいからなんだぁ……。", "zh": "因为看到有人因我的歌露出笑容时，我真的特别开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "daa05c66ef129180a1d0911cc50901f472de9d3b11f248e35f4cc2c0cb3e4278", "ja": "私じゃ力不足かもしれないけど……けど……ね……\n困った時は頼ってほしい。", "zh": "也许我的力量不够……但是……你要知道……\n遇到困难的时候，希望你能来找我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "07bd5ab11bf9c3da75eeced2b4a100fe4ce60a14f349cbe281f666144a1692de", "ja": "私は志保ちゃんの仲間だから、\nどんな志保ちゃんでもキライになんてならないよ。", "zh": "因为我是志保的伙伴，无论是怎样的志保，我都不会讨厌她的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "60dfb167989689edb05783bccd8c12f4f9b66cf902c34c6ff7d0ce9353349ade", "ja": "私は歌と同じくらい志保ちゃんが大好きだから。だから\n私は、志保ちゃんといっしょにアイドルがしたいの。", "zh": "因为我喜欢志保，和喜欢唱歌一样喜欢。所以，我想和志保一起当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "2ba8b899c94b851afc53f665f4467ec51198ade2fc30929ede19d15c289ad9f4", "ja": "悲しいときは歌うよ。私の歌の実力はまだまだだし、\n私は魔法なんて使えないけど。", "zh": "难过的时候，我会唱歌。虽然我的歌唱实力还远远不够，\n虽然我也不会使用魔法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "7f37d09f243b5583c180ef21c271a086af246a0a66c10d8aba73db371827f4f4", "ja": "私の歌が誰かを笑顔にできる。\nおまじないくらいにはなるって信じてるから。", "zh": "因为我相信，我的歌能让某个人露出笑容，至少也能成为小小的魔法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "b0bb747f694a33df10938c349ea76e91d642f8499f6b1f017c35dc36271c240b", "ja": "みんなをニコニコ笑顔にしちゃうのが、\nアイドルだって思うから。", "zh": "因为我觉得，让大家都露出笑容，就是偶像该做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "b10dbcec594001b956957b6ea13c69d751e64a559c2ffa8858b14fdb9d148352", "ja": "矢吹可奈はアイドルなんです～♪", "zh": "矢吹可奈就是偶像哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1040_029umi", "source_sha256": "50aa777771752e0a672a8c330b1fbd685a722f6ed111a8b23208527d3c000536", "ja": "かなりんの歌、こっちから聞こえたよね！", "zh": "可奈的歌声，是从这边传来的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1041_022ser", "source_sha256": "71ff71d7669f034232f3c7f44607c4e3752b10e2bc49d54f4355eb794ff4bcc2", "ja": "いました！", "zh": "找到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1042_033sih", "source_sha256": "c33976ca39bfcd866ddfcaa11f337d486395b47d9c40cb302a3765d9e439cd12", "ja": "星梨花！？　海美さん……！！", "zh": "星梨花！？海美小姐……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1043_022ser", "source_sha256": "50954389fbbf523e09e308ec68cec4f454710a473c5aae0c7843f3b168ae50c7", "ja": "志保さん！！", "zh": "志保姐！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_04_1044_029umi", "source_sha256": "0617e4823f95a0fa5efe966fa3f508352c4c65c3ddbcbb9bee260b85825272a5", "ja": "しほりん！！", "zh": "志保！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
